35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The minutes show they argued about sweeping within two years.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Shizue,,The bin house smells worse inside than the open pile.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
