48,2,3,talk,Rin,,The frontages are uneven. One is crossed by a driveway.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,Last year's shelters cost an average of two hundred forty-eight thousand.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Kenji,,"@Rin, if the frontages are uneven, rotation might be hard.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
