53,2,4,talk,Rin,,"@Shizue, the truck time is a problem for managed hours.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Servas,,"@Asuka, the ledger costs are ongoing. We need a sustainable plan.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
